%% Regenerate: PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=$(command -v chromium) pnpm dlx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i diagrams/loop-flow.mmd -o /tmp/loop-flow.png -w 1600 -b white
%%             cwebp -q 90 /tmp/loop-flow.png -o diagrams/loop-flow.webp
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Coding: loop triggered
    Coding --> Auditing: loop-handoff
    Auditing --> Coding: loop-handoff, findings remain, retry section
    Auditing --> Coding: loop-handoff, clean, next section
    Auditing --> PostAction: loop-handoff, clean, no section left, post-action configured
    Auditing --> [*]: loop-handoff, clean, no section left
    PostAction --> [*]: loop-complete
    Coding --> [*]: 3 turns without loop-handoff (handoff_missing) / max iterations / 3 consecutive errors / stall timeout / cancellation
    Auditing --> [*]: 3 turns without loop-handoff (handoff_missing)
    PostAction --> [*]: 3 turns without loop-complete (completed)
    note right of Coding
        Loops start by creating a git worktree, an
        optional msb sandbox, and a code session.
        Plan loops decompose the plan into up to
        24 sections once at start.
    end note
    note right of Auditing
        A section advances only when no bug finding is
        outstanding for it, any earlier section, or
        across sections; when no section is still open,
        a clean audit finishes the loop.
        Same-section retries reuse the previous coder
        and audit sessions; a new section, a recurring
        finding, or an unavailable session starts
        fresh ones.
    end note
    note left of PostAction
        Only when loop.postAction.enabled
        and a non-empty skill or prompt is set
    end note
